Station objectives
At the end of this station, you should be able to:
• Identify features of sternum;
• Identify features of thoracic vertebra;
• Identify different parts of the typical ribs;
• Identify true and false ribs;
• Distinguish between typical and atypical ribs;
• Identify different parts of the First rib;
• Articulate a typical rib with its corresponding vertebrae.
